<title>USA: USLIFE promotes Schlomann to CFO.</title>
<headline>USLIFE promotes Schlomann to CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>USLIFE Corp said on Tuesday that it promoted James Schlomann to senior executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>A company release said Schlomann replaces Greer Henderson, who was elected chief executive officer in February.</p>
<p>Schlomann joined USLIFE in October 1993 as executive vice president of financial operations and was promoted to executive vice president of finance in February 1996, the company said.</p>
</text>
